{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:58:53+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Three Kingdoms Era in China 2000 years ago", "steam_appid": 2425740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3044860, 5076890, 5337530, 5435330], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Title: Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the turbulent era of the Three Kingdoms in ancient China, &quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms&quot; transports players to a time of legendary heroes, epic battles, and strategic conquests. This immersive strategy game allows players to relive the glory and chaos of one of the most iconic periods in Chinese history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Han dynasty has crumbled, giving rise to a power struggle among warlords vying for control over the fragmented lands. As the flames of war spread, heroes emerge, each with their own ambitions and dreams of unification. Players will step into the shoes of famous generals, cunning strategists, and fearless warriors to shape the fate of the Three Kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical Authenticity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously recreated historical settings and events based on extensive research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic figures such as Cao Cao, Liu Bei, Sun Quan, and many more come to life with rich backstories and authentic appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command armies, devise tactics, and engage in large-scale battles that require both cunning and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of units, from infantry and cavalry to archers and siege weapons, each with unique strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Storyline:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a branching narrative that adapts to your choices, with multiple endings reflecting the diverse outcomes of the era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in famous battles and pivotal moments that can alter the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Immersion:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rich tapestry of Chinese culture through detailed depictions of architecture, clothing, and customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter legendary figures from Chinese folklore and mythology, enhancing the game’s depth and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI and Multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself against advanced AI opponents that adapt to your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete or cooperate with players worldwide in multiplayer modes, forging alliances or facing off in epic clashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management and Diplomacy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, build and upgrade cities, and maintain the morale of your troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in diplomacy, forge alliances, and negotiate with other factions to achieve your strategic goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Significance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms&quot; is not just a game; it is a celebration of the rich heritage and timeless wisdom of ancient China. By blending historical accuracy with engaging gameplay, the game offers a unique educational experience, promoting a deeper understanding of the Three Kingdoms period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to lead your forces to victory, outwit your rivals, and unite the land under your banner? Embark on an epic journey through the annals of history and create your own legend in &quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms.&quot; The fate of the realm lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first deep combination of traditional Chinese stories and the European and American war strategy model, as Steve Jobs said, the combination of art and science can create great products! This sentence will surely go down in history.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Title: Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Background:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the turbulent era of the Three Kingdoms in ancient China, &quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms&quot; transports players to a time of legendary heroes, epic battles, and strategic conquests. This immersive strategy game allows players to relive the glory and chaos of one of the most iconic periods in Chinese history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Han dynasty has crumbled, giving rise to a power struggle among warlords vying for control over the fragmented lands. As the flames of war spread, heroes emerge, each with their own ambitions and dreams of unification. Players will step into the shoes of famous generals, cunning strategists, and fearless warriors to shape the fate of the Three Kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical Authenticity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously recreated historical settings and events based on extensive research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic figures such as Cao Cao, Liu Bei, Sun Quan, and many more come to life with rich backstories and authentic appearances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command armies, devise tactics, and engage in large-scale battles that require both cunning and might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of units, from infantry and cavalry to archers and siege weapons, each with unique strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Storyline:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a branching narrative that adapts to your choices, with multiple endings reflecting the diverse outcomes of the era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in famous battles and pivotal moments that can alter the course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Immersion:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the rich tapestry of Chinese culture through detailed depictions of architecture, clothing, and customs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter legendary figures from Chinese folklore and mythology, enhancing the game’s depth and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced AI and Multiplayer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself against advanced AI opponents that adapt to your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete or cooperate with players worldwide in multiplayer modes, forging alliances or facing off in epic clashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource Management and Diplomacy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, build and upgrade cities, and maintain the morale of your troops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in diplomacy, forge alliances, and negotiate with other factions to achieve your strategic goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural Significance:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms&quot; is not just a game; it is a celebration of the rich heritage and timeless wisdom of ancient China. By blending historical accuracy with engaging gameplay, the game offers a unique educational experience, promoting a deeper understanding of the Three Kingdoms period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to lead your forces to victory, outwit your rivals, and unite the land under your banner? Embark on an epic journey through the annals of history and create your own legend in &quot;Chronicles of Bamboo Annals: Records of Three Kingdoms.&quot; The fate of the realm lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first deep combination of traditional Chinese stories and the European and American war strategy model, as Steve Jobs said, the combination of art and science can create great products! This sentence will surely go down in history.</p>", "short_description": "This is a Chinese historical story game that chronicles the dusty past of the Sima Yi family during the late Han Dynasty and the Three Kingdoms period - the unification of the Three Kingdoms.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Danish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Norwegian<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong>, Indonesian<strong>*</strong>, Finnish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic